N 204 Design III: Time, SCAD. Edited in CapCut.</p><p class="meta"><a href="https://youtu.be/1s5Vp_eNTwQ">Watch on YouTube</a></p></div></div><div class="frame strip"><iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/aJOVE4D-FUY" title="Confusion (2024)" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen" allowfullscreen></iframe><div class="cap"><h3>Confusion (2024)</h3><p class="tags"><span class="tag">Short</span><span class="tag">Class project</span></p><p class="meta">FILM 232 Lighting &amp; Camera, SCAD. Edited in CapCut.</p><p class="meta"><a href="https://youtu.be/aJOVE4D-FUY">Watch on YouTube</a></p></div></div><div class="frame strip"><iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/t6eaQEF1ULk" title="Procrastination (2024)" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen" allowfullscreen></iframe><div class="cap"><h3>Procrastination (2024)</h3><p class="tags"><span class="tag">Short</span><span class="tag">Class project</span></p><p class="meta">FILM 232 Lighting &amp; Camera, SCAD.</p><p class="meta"><a href="https://youtu.be/t6eaQEF1ULk">Watch on YouTube</a></p></div></div></div></section>
